    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight tactical battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your units, take advantage of your strengths and defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/91b69490e5d8bdfa640ba188792cf6cc.poster.avif?t=1750963522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/91b69490e5d8bdfa640ba188792cf6cc.webm?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/91b69490e5d8bdfa640ba188792cf6cc.mp4?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock powerful units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and upgrade to better units to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/e40c1e3a79226462e38d7ce5b3c389ce.poster.avif?t=1750963522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/e40c1e3a79226462e38d7ce5b3c389ce.webm?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/e40c1e3a79226462e38d7ce5b3c389ce.mp4?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create buildings to produce more resources, upgrade your cities to allocate more buildings, colonize new settlements to grow your provinces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/332f4d1d21356d4e2910ee4fb3460915.poster.avif?t=1750963522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/332f4d1d21356d4e2910ee4fb3460915.webm?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/332f4d1d21356d4e2910ee4fb3460915.mp4?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go to war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire armies and attack your enemies, conquer their cities or burn them to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/20567bbde9821c87de96a7d408d4a518.poster.avif?t=1750963522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/20567bbde9821c87de96a7d408d4a518.webm?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/20567bbde9821c87de96a7d408d4a518.mp4?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your next move, use the terrain to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/3e41ca09c83449228400d462006cc7ae.poster.avif?t=1750963522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/3e41ca09c83449228400d462006cc7ae.webm?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/3e41ca09c83449228400d462006cc7ae.mp4?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research technologies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather knowledge and research new technologies to develop your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/f6c1901eb6b62fe4cc1ef2b2225af8bf.poster.avif?t=1750963522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/f6c1901eb6b62fe4cc1ef2b2225af8bf.webm?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/f6c1901eb6b62fe4cc1ef2b2225af8bf.mp4?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore new lands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new regions to colonize and expand your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/0d2ed1350a74d1248e050d9a6e0ca7c3.poster.avif?t=1750963522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/0d2ed1350a74d1248e050d9a6e0ca7c3.webm?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/0d2ed1350a74d1248e050d9a6e0ca7c3.mp4?t=1750963522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
